<title>USA: Chicago $183 mln bonds repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Chicago $183 mln bonds repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Thursday it repriced Chicago's $182.7 million Skyway revenue bond issue, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2023 unchanged at approximately 5.799 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CITY OF CHICAGO, ILLINOIS</p>
<p>RE: $182,730,000*</p>
<p>SKYWAY TOLL BRIDGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/2006		6,345M    6.00  %	  5.00</p>
<p>01/01/2007		6,660M    6.00  %	  5.10</p>
<p>01/01/2008		7,005M    5.125 %	  5.25</p>
<p>01/01/2009		7,370M    5.25  %	  5.35</p>
<p>01/01/2010		7,765M    5.375 %	  5.45</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>01/01/2011		8,185M    5.375 %	  5.50</p>
<p>01/01/2016	     47,930M    5.375 %	 96.00</p>
<p>						  (Approx. Yield 5.722)</p>
<p>01/01/2023	     91,470M    5.50  %	 96.00</p>
<p>						  (Approx. Yield 5.799)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, November 15, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 4, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
